    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61341" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κων-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶνος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cone-shaped, conical</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				14.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.410d
			</span></i>; esp. in Math., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐπιφάνεια,
				γραμμαί, τομαί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Sph. Cyl.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Papp.
				672.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				662.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωνικά, τά</span>, <i>Conic Sections</i>, title of work by
			Apollonius Pergaeus, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Con.Sph.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. στοιχεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Quadr.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὅροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Papp.
					922.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. προβλήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollon.Perg.
					<u>Con.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			
			<u>Praef.</u>
